{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "4cfd3cca4cb52d7608b68b3b4d0f6dd4daf9ceca455c0c2281301581eab06db7", "ja": "ゆきゆきふれふれ～♪　\nみんなでほんわか♪　かまくらパーティー♪", "zh": "大雪大雪一直下～♪\n大家一团和气♪举办雪屋派对♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "eb92d71ee85d2858286548f975795b3a3ca07bd2308914cef8183ef1a1ec6c22", "ja": "青羽さん、お疲れさまです……？\nどうしたんですか、歌なんか歌って。", "zh": "青羽小姐，辛苦了……？\n发生什么事了吗？居然唱起歌来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "b934f760214c29c589dd3a988bdd153b40db732de66e4888414db994f738312c", "ja": "ぽかぽかふわふ……、あっ！\n{$P$}さん！？", "zh": "暖呼呼……啊！\n{$P$}先生！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_intro_1003_p", "source_sha256": "50c97c2a2a5dcb1eae02380a413b0b1bec300e6bb6b409c83c16bc4f168df328", "ja": "なんだかおもしろい歌ですね。\nもしかしてオリジナルですか？", "zh": "这首歌听起来真有趣。\n该不会是你自己想的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "d4040c9e58b4131d0fa0e29e7471b70a19171f0707017c89671b27ff12462649", "ja": "あ、ええと、その、オリジナルです……。\nうう、お恥ずかしい……。", "zh": "啊、呃、对，是我自己想的……\n呜呜，好难为情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "b9881ca30090af946ea64729abe7f1deb8c353b94bbd9674b8219c31bcd3a664", "ja": "そ、そうだ！　{$P$}さん、\nまた社長さんがお呼びだそうですっ！", "zh": "对、对了！{$P$}先生，\n社长又有事情要找你啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_intro_1006_p", "source_sha256": "ce6bdfcdc8e8bfdaf4e5e8d4d052fca47070be185ee56d3156183dd9ff4e2bd9", "ja": "おや、そうなんですか！　例の企画の\nことかな？　早速行ってみますね！", "zh": "哎呀，这样啊！会是之前那个企划吗？\n我这就过去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_intro_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "e131c1f19e77432aa8734e2a8fccec819e44a510ace91ded11dc1202021adbf5", "ja": "は、はーい！　行ってらっしゃーい！\n……ふぅ。", "zh": "好、好的～！请慢走～！\n……呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_intro_1008_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_intro_1009_p", "source_sha256": "01ed0d719a1cc2da5f8b137c60028e4d33a160319bc572ae13c783c9208ad36d", "ja": "失礼します！\n社長、音無さん、お疲れ様です！", "zh": "打扰了。\n社长、音无小姐，辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_intro_1010_101kot", "source_sha256": "a2a8a800148983bd962066f0e43e86944bd6111369cac8d1f75360ed7905ccf2", "ja": "お疲れ様です、{$P$}さん！　\n今日は一段と寒いですねぇ。", "zh": "工作辛苦了，{$P$}先生！\n今天特别冷呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_intro_1011_president", "source_sha256": "8a4a3376abde1b34694b5017346c1f5b8856f96896b42baa80259f537f9e5d8e", "ja": "おお君、来てくれたか。寒い中、すまないな。\n身体は冷えてないかね？", "zh": "喔喔，你来啦。大冷天还要你过来，真不好意思。\n有没有着凉啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_intro_1012_101kot", "source_sha256": "751f3c0d453a400885afffb5da0d82610f862962c4b8838213ad91d3649beddd", "ja": "少しエアコンの温度、上げますね。", "zh": "我把空调的温度调高点吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_intro_1013_se", "source_sha256": "0618057f5a5fdd40309349b31b32a80d16232cbd3e662077e9b42358d8ff5d6b", "ja": "ピピッ♪　ンゴゴ……ズシュゥ……\n……ウォォオ～ム……", "zh": "哔哔♪嗡嗡嗡……咻咻……\n……嗡嗡嗡嗡……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_intro_1014_p", "source_sha256": "db3a16923fa356df6066060d7d38669b3ca8761139e11844cba1573983d8d84f", "ja": "……ああ、あったかい！\nありがとうございます、音無さん。", "zh": "……喔喔，好暖和！\n谢谢你，音无小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_intro_1015_p", "source_sha256": "3259f5c50de9c623e53095ec6fbca6e034ae772c8e3eebf48c6261fef159d3cb", "ja": "ところで社長、お話というのは……？", "zh": "对了，社长，请问究竟是什么事呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_intro_1016_president", "source_sha256": "70ecc54d535d46dc75218e52abdfb661fb89742bfc8b2da4293891b0a847fd80", "ja": "ああ、そうそう。君が提案してくれた、\n例の天体公演を定期公演にする話だが……。", "zh": "喔喔，我都忘了。是关于你之前的提案，\n那个天体公演的定期公演……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_intro_1017_president", "source_sha256": "accbd29eac3d071aaa2f4ea273a92df8203082041a8529d44843b98af4b18e60", "ja": "素晴らしいアイディアだね！　アイドルの定番公演\nらしいテーマでもあるし、ぜひ進めてくれたまえ！", "zh": "这主意真是太棒了！这样的主题也很适合\n作为偶像的例行公演，你一定要继续推动下去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_intro_1018_p", "source_sha256": "67f6a5b1da97f1362c5679c760bd3c5ddc886c910694a1100ee9ca54338cc313", "ja": "おお、ありがとうございます！", "zh": "喔喔，谢谢社长！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_intro_1019_president", "source_sha256": "c175e82a33147f8c7745c6dba925cfcdd2e499fc6d8354e9dd55d79f421a0b87", "ja": "そして、君が次の公演でのお披露目用にと\n言っていた新曲も、ちょうど届いたところだ。", "zh": "然后呢，你希望要在下次公演上\n发表的新歌也正好送来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_intro_1020_president", "source_sha256": "254825d900a4cfafee854190fa41df2599d09b7c7b032070905b4d196f34a112", "ja": "君の想定通り、新たな時代を切り開いてくれそうな曲に\n仕上がっているよ！　さっそく、聴いてみよう！", "zh": "成果符合你的预期，应该会是首开拓新时代的歌曲！\n赶紧来听听看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_intro_1022_p", "source_sha256": "c1dd58e742f928ff475def6c766879a27b575c1bf5b5e4a07e01a6cd4bb50f59", "ja": "これは……！　想定通りどころか、想定を上回る\n格好良さです！　俺も気合いを入れなきゃ。", "zh": "这……！岂止符合，根本是帅气到超出预期啊！\n看来我也得加倍努力了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_intro_1023", "source_sha256": "ffad244633da91bc44eb4838e7d23347f2d78e35b0ce860fb08eacf3167d8bf5", "ja": "キリッ！", "zh": "正色！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_intro_2000_p", "source_sha256": "04a615bb45968879498f7b82bf1ff009d6d5b1d8d75bbcd09c34d30c38b4db91", "ja": "（キリッ！）", "zh": "（正色！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_intro_2001_101kot", "source_sha256": "1ebaaf48cdfa8760b4ce390da26564b0f9c0b297fc03a8a95ef9dee31da05bba", "ja": "（ピヨッ！？）", "zh": "（啾！？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_intro_2002_president", "source_sha256": "926d3dee06cb9c315ac191062bc2a5ff55b3a5697da889c9a45b0122961d9d33", "ja": "うんうん、実に結構！　この曲の良さを活かして、\nまた素晴らしい公演にしてくれたまえ！", "zh": "嗯嗯，非常好！发挥这首歌曲的长处，\n继续为我们带来精采的公演吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_intro_2003_p", "source_sha256": "b01da817227a3ddd1566f4c8c721c602bbaa9267e800f418abb8182399d002bb", "ja": "はいっ！　あ、ちょっと熱くなりすぎたかな……。\n上着、脱がせてもらってもいいですか？", "zh": "是！啊，我是不是太激动了点……\n请问我可以脱掉外套吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_intro_2004", "source_sha256": "7e3c67ca688da486630fe2b1b7071a6791672d73fe912706e0440acba3f4513a", "ja": "バサッ！", "zh": "啪唰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_intro_3000_p", "source_sha256": "ae6805664e3a96c037a9a63633b9faf07a1d07d053d006801b22aafdc3814db7", "ja": "（バサッ！）", "zh": "（啪唰！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_intro_3001_101kot", "source_sha256": "9a985c65703363ec535d056ede01bbb1156819627d786eb7c95853afe56525fd", "ja": "（ドキッ！）", "zh": "（心动！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_intro_3002_p", "source_sha256": "5cbf242f08f7b77f2fd6eedd06b75c75682cc0e47d01fb7ace82a38231413398", "ja": "あ、ついでに腕まくりも失礼します。", "zh": "啊，不好意思，也让我卷起袖子吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_intro_3003", "source_sha256": "15fbc273f86d07bb3a7c85f0354645027a524efe92ea3b11b2e9a3378687e39e", "ja": "グイッ！", "zh": "卷起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_intro_4000_p", "source_sha256": "2bed7dcce8310d3da983c8bcd482780dae7ce4c53972d6be9df0950a158a0fe2", "ja": "（グイッ！）", "zh": "（卷起！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_intro_4001_101kot", "source_sha256": "8a1fd220d3cda6118a60856d9b4afd21442896a6ca4ba7e53797160361017cbf", "ja": "（はああっ！）", "zh": "（哇啊啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_intro_4002_101kot", "source_sha256": "5f15ee70e37b8fe49e005d548bc3781299415c53c49d1a3aad5d2c2bd0df9ad3", "ja": "（きょ、今日の{$P$}さん、\nやけにワイルドだわ！　ときめくわ！）", "zh": "（今、今天的{$P$}先生\n特别狂野呢！令人小鹿乱撞啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_intro_4003_101kot", "source_sha256": "0f894035b51a35d194437725c5ec955b61991264a172d4e7c39a76f4b5e59601", "ja": "（……って、ダメよ小鳥、今はお仕事中じゃない。\nあの逞しい腕を見ちゃダメ！　で、でも～～～！）", "zh": "（……等一下，不行啊，小鸟，现在可是工作时间！\n不可以看那结实的手臂！可、可是～～～！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_intro_4004_p", "source_sha256": "c1f9f29832b391aac794502a8d7c7cc7bf7597f33ff29a9e4e664777642a1cc4", "ja": "あれ？　どうしたんですか、音無さん。", "zh": "奇怪？音无小姐，你怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_intro_4005_101kot", "source_sha256": "78506c0c20f6aeb1c553353c3ceea1754b577fa2747be2d197de7d63f4927265", "ja": "……ぴ、ピヨ～！！", "zh": "……啾、啾啾～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_intro_4006_president", "source_sha256": "9a7d74a3d0b221c226d9c4c6b6aad3232518fedd14858f88d72079a1d1664b8a", "ja": "音無君？　顔が赤いようだが……はっ、もしかして\n風邪かね！？　大変だ！　この置き薬を……！", "zh": "音无？你的脸好红……啊！该不会是感冒了！？\n真糟糕！不过我正好有感冒药……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_intro_4007_101kot", "source_sha256": "f1b8e906c8ea1ed2834740b1387b8857ef19f59aa6112aaa7612e24b59aadf6e", "ja": "だ、大丈夫です社長！　なんでもないんです！\nあ、きっとエアコンのせいだわ！　温度下げますね！", "zh": "我、我没事的，社长！我身体好得很！\n啊，一定是空调太热了！我把温度调低吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_intro_4008_president", "source_sha256": "b6ba9a5be0520abe2475da31236d8ec0fae1faf3990530a73b0602f802fb1283", "ja": "む、そうか。なんでもないのなら、いいんだが……。\nま、健康第一で頼むよ、音無君！", "zh": "唔，这样啊，你没事就好……\n总之，要保重身体啊，音无！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_intro_4009_president", "source_sha256": "92cecf50d5f354011be0dd9f0d302cdb12efa1401db471006f4f514fe0bfc133", "ja": "というわけで、\n君も体調にはくれぐれも注意しつつ……。", "zh": "事情就是这样，\n你也要多加注意自己的健康状况……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
