{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_intro_4011_p", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_intro_4012_p", "source_sha256": "c9cbd832a6d6030fa1b8de49b99e0c4c72b10ba685e5b4259d5ec462c53c68a3", "ja": "（さあ、待望の天体公演がまた始まる。\n忙しい日々の始まりだ。気合い入れていこう！）", "zh": "（好，期待已久的天体公演又要开始了。\n我也要忙碌起来了，拿出干劲吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
